rousel_yVp4iM"],"settings":{"include_padding":true}},"dynamic_image_with_text_LWBxWz":{"type":"dynamic-image-with-text","name":"t:sections.image_with_text.presets.image_with_text.name","settings":{"section_heading":"Piercing Gifts for Valentine's Day","image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/ChatGPT_Image_Jan_26_2026_12_32_15_PM.png","desktop_height":"600px","mobile_height":"natural","desktop_image_alignment":"left","mobile_image_alignment":"top","heading":"More Than Just a Gift: High-Quality Piercing Jewellery","subheading":"<p>Make this holiday truly personal with a selection from our <strong>Valentine’s Piercing <\/strong>Jewellery collection. We have curated a mix of heart-inspired designs and romantic staples that work perfectly as <a href=\"https:\/\/www.monsterpiercing.com\/collections\/valentines-day-gifts\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Monster Piercing Valentine's Gift Collection\"><strong>Valentine’s gifts<\/strong><\/a> for partners, friends, or even a treat for yourself. Whether you are celebrating <strong>Galentine’s Day<\/strong> or planning a romantic surprise, there is something here for every piercing lover.<\/p><p>You will find high-quality options that fit as Valentine’s Day gifts for her, along with a dedicated range of Valentine’s Day gifts for him featuring edgy styles in Solid Gold and Implant-Grade Titanium. These body-safe materials ensure comfort and durability, allowing you to create matching piercings for couples that can be worn every day. It is simple to build a unique ear curation or find a standalone piece that feels like the best Valentine’s gift—thoughtful, stylish, and safe.<\/p><p>Browse the edit below to find your perfect match and take advantage of our <strong>Valentine’s Day jewellery sale<\/strong>. With special offers on our premium Gold and Titanium pieces, you can gift luxury body jewellery that they will cherish long after the day is over.<\/p>","text_alignment":"left","button_label":"Browse Valentine's Collection","button_link":"https:\/\/www.monsterpiercing.com\/collections\/valentines-day-gifts"}},"valentine_faq_gAyBbA":{"type":"valentine-faq","blocks":{"faq_item_KkNMBG":{"type":"faq_item","settings":{"question":"What is the most popular Valentine gift?","answer":"<p>While flowers and chocolates are traditional, <strong>luxury jewellery<\/strong> is the most popular lasting gift. In 2025, curated <strong>ear piercing stacks<\/strong> (sets of matching studs and hoops) and solid gold body jewellery have become top-trending gifts because they offer a more personalized and modern alternative to standard necklaces.<\/p>"}},"faq_item_wgrG3J":{"type":"faq_item","settings":{"question":"What is a good gift for Valentine's Day for her?","answer":"<p>A good gift balances sentiment with style. If she has piercings, <strong>14k gold cartilage earrings<\/strong> (like Helix or Tragus studs) are excellent choices because they are something she wears 24\/7. Unlike a dress that is worn once, high-quality titanium or gold piercing jewellery becomes a permanent part of her daily look.<\/p>"}},"faq_item_pcTbFF":{"type":"faq_item","settings":{"question":"What to gift for Valentine's Day?","answer":"<p>For a unique luxury gift, consider a <strong>\"Piercing Experience\"<\/strong> package. Pairing a high-end 14k gold attachment with a gift card for a styling or piercing appointment allows the recipient to choose the perfect placement. It transforms a simple physical gift into a memorable event.<\/p>"}},"faq_item_qq34yr":{"type":"faq_item","settings":{"question":"Which gift girl likes most?","answer":"<p>Most women prefer gifts that feel <strong>personal and thoughtful<\/strong>. Jewellery that fits her specific anatomy—such as a perfectly sized <strong>conch hoop<\/strong> or a <strong>diamond nose stud<\/strong>—shows you paid attention to her style. Personalized \"initial\" studs or birthstone body jewellery are consistently top-rated for this reason.<\/p>"}},"faq_item_NHL6kQ":{"type":"faq_item","settings":{"question":"Is jewellery a good Valentine's Day gift?","answer":"<p>Yes, jewellery is the gold standard for Valentine's Day. However, <strong>body jewellery<\/strong> (navel rings, nipple bars, or ear stack sets) is often seen as more intimate and edgy than standard jewellery. It implies a deeper level of closeness and attention to detail, making it perfect for romantic partners.<\/p>"}},"faq_item_4bMpXw":{"type":"faq_item","settings":{"question":"What is the best jewellery for a new piercing gift?","answer":"<p>Safety is the priority for new piercings. The best gift is <strong>Implant-Grade Titanium (ASTM F-136)<\/strong> or <strong>Solid 14k\/18k Gold<\/strong> (nickel-free). Avoid plated gold or sterling silver for fresh piercings as they can cause irritation. A \"flat back labret\" stud is the safest and most versatile style to gift.<\/p>"}},"faq_item_h88xHV":{"type":"faq_item","settings":{"question":"How do I choose the right size piercing jewellery for a gift?","answer":"<p>If you cannot measure her current jewellery, stick to <strong>\"Standard Sizes.\"<\/strong><\/p><ul><li><strong>Lobe:<\/strong> 18g or 20g<\/li><li><strong>Helix\/Cartilage:<\/strong> 16g (6mm or 8mm length)<\/li><li><strong>Nose:<\/strong> 18g or 20g (L-shape or screw)<\/li><li><em>Tip: When in doubt, buy a \"threadless top\" (the decorative front part) as these fit almost any post size.<\/em><\/li><\/ul>"}},"faq_item_bm64GK":{"type":"faq_item","settings":{"question":"Is a nose ring a romantic gift?","answer":"<p>Yes, in many cultures, nose rings symbolize marriage or serious commitment. In modern fashion, a <strong>diamond or real gold nose stud<\/strong> is considered a sophisticated, luxury gift. It is a small but constant reminder of the giver since it is right on the face and seen every time she looks in the mirror.<\/p>"}},"faq_item_T3dbP6":{"type":"faq_item","settings":{"question":"Can I gift a piercing appointment for Valentine's Day?","answer":"<p>Absolutely. Gifting a \"future appointment\" is a great solution if you are unsure of her size or style. Present it physically by wrapping a <strong>luxury jewellery box<\/strong> containing a \"placeholder\" piece (like a simple gold stud) alongside the booking confirmation, so she has something to open on the day.<\/p>"}}},"block_order":["faq_item_KkNMBG","faq_item_wgrG3J","faq_item_pcTbFF","faq_item_qq34yr","faq_item_NHL6kQ","faq_item_4bMpXw","faq_item_h88xHV","faq_item_bm64GK","faq_item_T3dbP6"],"name":"Valentine FAQ","settings":{"heading":"Valentine's Day FAQ","subheading":"Got questions about Valentine's gifts? We've got answers!","heading_size":60,"heading_color":"#db1e37","max_width":900,"padding_top":30,"padding_bottom":30,"background_color":"#fef0f0","question_background":"#ffffff","question_text_color":"#333333","answer_background":"#ffffff","answer_text_color":"#666666","border_color":"#ffc0cb","hover_color":"#da475a","icon_color":"#d2485b","border_radius":30,"icon_style":"none","animation_style":"bounce","close_others":true,"auto_open_first":true,"show_decorative_hearts":false}}},"order":["main","blocks_hL46yJ","blocks_tqr779","dynamic_video_wEXB6w","collection_circles_xyPacK","blocks_Tgf8aX","1769411762f8a3527d","get_the_look_L79iBK","get_the_look_JAHPY7","dynamic_countdown_timer_BiMCBL","shop_by_type_iWpKKn","featured_banner_products_XLRQTi","apps_eMez3T","dynamic_image_with_text_LWBxWz","valentine_faq_gAyBbA"]}